{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sea of Mirrors is both a classic spot-the-difference game and a light arithmetic puzzle. Your goal is to spot the creatures whose reflections don't match their own image. The creatures are also assigned a number/operation that help you match the spell score for every round to successfully complete a turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051760/extras/be68067310dcaa0bc79ac087392e0628.poster.avif?t=1771008172\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051760/extras/be68067310dcaa0bc79ac087392e0628.webm?t=1771008172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the levels are procedurally generated but with thought and care put into each formula/algorithm. Each level has a singular characteristic that introduces a unique challenge. With numbers, that could be a trick on even/odd numbers, multiplication, aiming for the largest value, etc. Visually, it could be a play on color difference, symmetry, position, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game only requires careful observation and a basic understanding of elementary arithmetic, making it approachable for players of nearly all age. For those seeking more, optional achievements offer extra layers of challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051760/extras/e0e55e9a53e00608cf3a0cb9691d42ed.poster.avif?t=1771008172\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051760/extras/e0e55e9a53e00608cf3a0cb9691d42ed.webm?t=1771008172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the land and its reflecting sea and use your wizarding skills to free the creatures from the water's illusions!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4051760?t=1771008172","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051760/c78b3d336a28d38147ea9f92f5a36e6f4b2b9225/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771008172","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051760/bb8ede84ca87d6cbf52b45b1da591b01fd82e6fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771008172","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051760/bb8ede84ca87d6cbf52b45b1da591b01fd82e6fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771008172","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sea of Mirrors is both a classic spot-the-difference game and a light arithmetic puzzle. Your goal is to spot the creatures whose reflections don't match their own image. The creatures are also assigned a number/operation that help you match the spell score for every round to successfully complete a turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051760/extras/be68067310dcaa0bc79ac087392e0628.poster.avif?t=1771008172\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051760/extras/be68067310dcaa0bc79ac087392e0628.webm?t=1771008172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the levels are procedurally generated but with thought and care pu